; XAUUSD_M1_LiquidityZeroCross_Bearish v1.20 - BTCUSD M5 trigger / H2 trend / 07:00-20:00 server time
; FINAL CALIBRATION (research/final_calibration.py): 39 timeframe pairs x 324 structure x 5 trailing x 2 sessions x stochastic, then the v1.20 options on the top setups. Settings chosen with 2025 data ONLY.
; Options: trend EMA, stochastic hard, TP zones, tolerance 7290 pts + buffer 1458 pts, trailing 10934/3645 pts.
; Backtest (Binance BTCUSDT, 5 USD spread, Jan 2025-May 2026): 108 trades, PF 1.82-2.20 across the four same-bar fill models; 2025 PF 2.64 / 2.37; 2026 (out of sample) PF 1.51-1.74 on 29 trades.
; Shipped because it held up in 2026; that pick among 10 pairs uses 2026, so expect live results below these.
; LOW-COST BROKERS ONLY: MaxSpread_Points=1000 (10 USD) blocks entries when the spread is wider. Tight trailing distances cannot be judged on one-minute bars: confirm with real ticks in MT5.
; Session hours are BROKER SERVER TIME (TradingHoursAreGMT=false). They were calibrated on FTMO data whose clock is GMT+2 winter / GMT+3 summer (New York close).
; UseNewsFilter=true was NOT part of the backtest (no calendar history); live trade count and results will differ. Set it to false to match the backtest exactly.
